// 큰 검은 돌판·촛대 둘·해골 잔·붉은 인장만 남겨 또렷하게; 꼭대기 윗면 8행(y=14~21)
@size 32 32
@cell 16
@palette palette.pal
@mat a black 1
@mat b black 2
@mat c black 3
@mat d black 4
@mat e black 5
@mat k iron 2
@mat l iron 4
@mat p purple 2
@mat q purple 3
@mat r purple 4
@mat s purple 5
@mat t purple 6
@mat L linen 2
@mat M linen 3
@mat N linen 4
@mat O linen 5
@mat u red 1
@mat v red 2
@mat w red 3
@mat x red 4
@layer altar
@mblock 0 14
= 2. 27d 1c 2.
= 1. 1e 28d 1c 1.
= 1. 2e 26d 2c 1.
= 1. 1e 27d 2c 1.
= 1. 1e 5d 3c 19d 2c 1.
= 1. 1e 27d 2c 1.
= 1. 1e 20d 3c 4d 2c 1.
= 1. 28d 2c 1.
= 1. 28c 2a 1.
= 2. 2d 23b 3a 2.
= 2. 1d 1c 23b 3a 2.
= 2. 1d 1c 23b 3a 2.
= 2. 1d 1c 23b 3a 2.
= 2. 2c 23b 3a 2.
= 2. 1c 24b 3a 2.
= 1. 2d 26c 2a 1.
= 1. 1c 26b 3a 1.
= 1. 28a 2a 1.
@layer emblem
@mblock 12 24
.w...v.
.xw.vw.
..xww..
.wvuvv.
..wvw..
@layer offerings
// 두 불꽃: 밝은 중심은 왼쪽, 쇠 촛대 밑받침의 윗면도 보인다.
@mblock 5 6
..r..
..sr.
.rsqr
.rtpq
..l..
..l..
..k..
..k..
.lllk
.lkkk
..aa.
@mblock 23 6
..q..
..rq.
.qspr
.rtqp
..l..
..l..
..k..
..k..
.lllk
.lkkk
..aa.
// 해골 잔: 입구 3행, 눈구멍 두 덩이, 짧은 잔 다리.
@mblock 12 10
..NNN..
.NLbbMN
.OLbbMN
.ONNNML
.OaNaML
..NMML.
...k...
..lkk..
..aaa..
